  "text": "*Music*\nNow you said the princess to invite us over for a picnic, Eluigi!\nI hope they made lots of spaghetti!\nLuigi!\nLook!\nIt's from Bowser!\nDear pesky plumbers!\nThe koopalings and I have taken over the mushroom kingdom!\nThe princess is now a permanent guest at one of my seven koopa hotels!\nI dare you to find her if you can!\nWe've got to find the princess!\nAnd you've got to help us!\nIf you need instructions on how to get through the hotels,\ncheck out the enclosed instruction book!\n*Music*\nLooks kind of peaceful.\nLooks at the seating when koopas are involved.\n*Music*\n*Music*\n*Music*\nHey, princess!\n*Music*\n*Music*\n*Music*\nHow were we going to find the princess with the power I'm going out?\nMaybe there's a switch in one of the rules!\nRemind me to check!\n*Music*\nThat ought to do it!\n*Music*\nWhere'd she go?\n*Music*\nGee, it's kind of dark.\nYou're going to light?\nNo.\nWe'll maybe a koopa will win this here!\nIf we persuade.\n*Music*\n*Music*\nWhere am I?\n*Music*\nYou're ready to catch it!\nShe's not coming down!\nShe's up there!\n*Music*\nIt's hard to see through those clouds!\nI hope we can get rid of them!\nGet the hint!\n*Music*\n*Music*\n*Music*\n*Music*\nIt's been one of those days!\nCome on Luigi!\n*Music*\nWhoa!\nHurry!\n*Music*\n*Music*\n*Music*\n*Music*\n*Music*\nThat wasn't so high!\n*Music*\nThat's the creepy Bowser's laugh!\n*Music*\nThis is it Luigi!\nRemember where this is?\nCan't fight!\n*Music*\n*Music*\nThanks to you too!\nI can see through the mushroom area!\nCreepy, terrible cooking and cutting!\n*Music*\nAh!\nAnd my thanks to you too!\n*Music*\n*Music*",
  "srt": "1\n00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000\n *Music*\n\n2\n00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000\n Now you said the princess to invite us over for a picnic, Eluigi!\n\n3\n00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000\n I hope they made lots of spaghetti!\n\n4\n00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000\n Luigi!\n\n5\n00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,000\n Look!\n\n6\n00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000\n It's from Bowser!\n\n7\n00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000\n Dear pesky plumbers!\n\n8\n00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000\n The koopalings and I have taken over the mushroom kingdom!\n\n9\n00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000\n The princess is now a permanent guest at one of my seven koopa hotels!\n\n10\n00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000\n I dare you to find her if you can!\n\n11\n00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000\n We've got to find the princess!\n\n12\n00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000\n And you've got to help us!\n\n13\n00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000\n If you need instructions on how to get through the hotels,\n\n14\n00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000\n check out the enclosed instruction book!\n\n15\n00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,000\n *Music*\n\n16\n00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000\n Looks kind of peaceful.\n\n17\n00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:56,000\n Looks at the seating when koopas are involved.\n\n18\n00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000\n *Music*\n\n19\n00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000\n *Music*\n\n20\n00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000\n *Music*\n\n21\n00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,000\n Hey, princess!\n\n22\n00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000\n *Music*\n\n23\n00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000\n *Music*\n\n24\n00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000\n *Music*\n\n25\n00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000\n How were we going to find the princess with the power I'm going out?\n\n26\n00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,000\n Maybe there's a switch in one of the rules!\n\n27\n00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,000\n Remind me to check!\n\n28\n00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:40,000\n *Music*\n\n29\n00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,000\n That ought to do it!\n\n30\n00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,000\n *Music*\n\n31\n00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,000\n Where'd she go?\n\n32\n00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:54,000\n *Music*\n\n33\n00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,000\n Gee, it's kind of dark.\n\n34\n00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,000\n You're going to light?\n\n35\n00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000\n No.\n\n36\n00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,000\n We'll maybe a koopa will win this here!\n\n37\n00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,000\n If we persuade.\n\n38\n00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:13,000\n *Music*\n\n39\n00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:18,000\n *Music*\n\n40\n00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000\n Where am I?\n\n41\n00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,000\n *Music*\n\n42\n00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,000\n You're ready to catch it!\n\n43\n00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000\n She's not coming down!\n\n44\n00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,000\n She's up there!\n\n45\n00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:39,000\n *Music*\n\n46\n00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:43,000\n It's hard to see through those clouds!\n\n47\n00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,000\n I hope we can get rid of them!\n\n48\n00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000\n Get the hint!\n\n49\n00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:53,000\n *Music*\n\n50\n00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:59,000\n *Music*\n\n51\n00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:04,000\n *Music*\n\n52\n00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:08,000\n *Music*\n\n53\n00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:11,000\n It's been one of those days!\n\n54\n00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:14,000\n Come on Luigi!\n\n55\n00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:17,000\n *Music*\n\n56\n00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,000\n Whoa!\n\n57\n00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000\n Hurry!\n\n58\n00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:27,000\n *Music*\n\n59\n00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:31,000\n *Music*\n\n60\n00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:38,000\n *Music*\n\n61\n00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:45,000\n *Music*\n\n62\n00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:50,000\n *Music*\n\n63\n00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:54,000\n That wasn't so high!\n\n64\n00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:57,000\n *Music*\n\n65\n00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:02,000\n That's the creepy Bowser's laugh!\n\n66\n00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:07,000\n *Music*\n\n67\n00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:11,000\n This is it Luigi!\n\n68\n00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:14,000\n Remember where this is?\n\n69\n00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:17,000\n Can't fight!\n\n70\n00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:22,000\n *Music*\n\n71\n00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:29,000\n *Music*\n\n72\n00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,000\n Thanks to you too!\n\n73\n00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:34,000\n I can see through the mushroom area!\n\n74\n00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:39,000\n Creepy, terrible cooking and cutting!\n\n75\n00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:42,000\n *Music*\n\n76\n00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,000\n Ah!\n\n77\n00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:48,000\n And my thanks to you too!\n\n78\n00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:55,000\n *Music*\n\n79\n00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:58,000\n *Music*\n\n"
